  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gir&apos;ijambo &quot;Have a Say&quot; Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gir&apos;ijambo &quot;have a say&quot; activity seeks to re-establish and rebuild a vibrant, resilient and responsive civil society capable of holding the government of Burundi (GOB) accountable for pledged reforms and development outcomes in democracy, human rights, and governance (DRG) leading up to the next elections in 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
